OL,4,CIsraeli strike kills senior Hamas      
OL,5,Csecurity official and family in Gaza   
OL,6,CCity                                   
OL,7,GAn Israeli air strike in the Gaza      
OL,8,GStrip has killed a senior Hamas        
OL,9,Gsecurity official and three members of 
OL,10,Ghis family, according to local doctors 
OL,11,Gand the Hamas-run interior ministry.   
OL,13,FMohammed Abu al-Ouf, 47, the head of   
OL,14,FHamas's internal security service in   
OL,15,Fnorthern Gaza, his wife and their two  
OL,16,Fteenage daughters died when their      
OL,17,Fapartment in Shati refugee camp in     
OL,18,FGaza City was bombed at dawn, the      
OL,19,Fministry said.                         
